{"2665630": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Piecing It Together", "steam_appid": 2665630, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Construct 3D puzzles of beautiful dioramas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game provides a calm and meditative environment for you to enjoy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no scores, timers, or meters to worry about. It's just you and your puzzle pieces!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy a quick puzzling session with just a handful of pieces, or challenge yourself with many!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Piecing It Together is a modern take on a classic pastime that’s fun for the whole family!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Each puzzle has 4 Difficulties, from 20 Pieces up to 200 Pieces</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Meditative gameplay with no timers, meters or scores</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Save and resume your progress at any time</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Relax to our soundtrack inspired by Animal Crossing</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Push, pull, and rotate pieces to complete the puzzle!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2665630/extras/1e48ad8c31f46699a23bcf4125196678.poster.avif?t=1775202612\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2665630/extras/1e48ad8c31f46699a23bcf4125196678.webm?t=1775202612\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2665630/extras/1e48ad8c31f46699a23bcf4125196678.mp4?t=1775202612\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>